  //
  // ─── AUDITION TEMPLATE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // Copy this block into a comment above the entry you are adding or changing.
  // Fill in every field before merging. Incomplete entries must not ship.
  //
  //   Persona ID  : <persona key, e.g. "miller">
  //   Date        : <YYYY-MM-DD>
